desc: Punch Line Transient Shaper (mda Transient port) by chmaha
tags: transient shaper dynamics attack sustain drums
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Transient shaper: boost or cut the attack and the release (sustain) of each sound, without a
  threshold to set. Turn Attack up for more snap and punch, down to soften hits; turn Release up to
  bring out room and ring, down to tighten the tail. Att Hold and Rel Hold set how long each
  stage acts for. Filter limits the effect to the low end (left) or the high end (right) of the
  signal; the processed band is added to the dry signal. Works on the stereo sum, so both channels
  move together.
  Ported from mda Transient by Paul Kellett (Maxim Digital Audio), via mda-effects
  https://github.com/pluginguru/mda-effects (MIT or GPLv2+)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
// Copyright (C) 2008 Paul Kellett
